      <p>
        Customers need a short path from request to tracking. Staff need to see every shipment at
        once. Two apps would have kept two records that could disagree, so customers and staff
        read the same shipment record. Customers also get a readiness view.
      </p>
    </CaseProse>

    <div class="mt-12">
